@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DermAI Clinic - Triển khai local hiện hành (Docker Compose)
skinparam shadowing false

node "Máy phát triển Windows + Docker Desktop" as Host {
  node "Các cổng mở trên localhost" {
    component "Frontend Nginx\nlocalhost:3000" as Frontend
    component "API Gateway\nlocalhost:8080" as Gateway
    component "AI FastAPI\nlocalhost:8000" as AI
    component "Adminer\nlocalhost:8081" as Adminer
    database "PostgreSQL 16\nlocalhost:5432\n7 schema / 24 bảng" as PostgreSQL
    queue "RabbitMQ Management\nlocalhost:15672" as RabbitMQ
  }

  node "Mạng Docker nội bộ" {
    component "Auth Service :8082" as Auth
    component "Patient Service :8083" as PatientService
    component "Doctor Service :8084" as DoctorService
    component "Appointment Service :8085" as Appointment
    component "Medical Record Service :8086" as Record
    component "Prescription Service :8087" as Prescription
    component "Notification Service :8088" as Notification
    component "Redis :6379" as Redis
    artifact "best_model.pth" as Model
    artifact "RAG index" as Rag
  }

  folder "Named volume hiện có" {
    artifact "postgres_data" as PgVolume
  }
}

cloud "Gmail SMTP" as SMTP
cloud "Gemini API" as Gemini
actor "Trình duyệt local" as Browser

Browser --> Frontend : HTTP
Browser --> Gateway : HTTP / WebSocket
Browser --> AI : chỉ debug local
Browser --> Adminer : chỉ quản trị local
Frontend --> Gateway : /api + WebSocket
Gateway --> Auth
Gateway --> PatientService
Gateway --> DoctorService
Gateway --> Appointment
Gateway --> Record
Gateway --> Prescription
Gateway --> AI
Gateway --> Redis
Appointment --> RabbitMQ
RabbitMQ --> Notification
Notification --> SMTP
Auth --> PostgreSQL
PatientService --> PostgreSQL
DoctorService --> PostgreSQL
Appointment --> PostgreSQL
Record --> PostgreSQL
Prescription --> PostgreSQL
Notification --> PostgreSQL
AI --> Model
AI --> Rag
AI --> Gemini
Adminer --> PostgreSQL
PostgreSQL --> PgVolume

note bottom of Host
  Đây là trạng thái docker-compose.yml hiện tại, phục vụ phát triển/demo local.
  Chưa có TLS, reverse proxy production, backup tự động hoặc monitoring tập trung.
end note
@enduml
